<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Tissue raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Tissue raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Advanced Tissue Sciences Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Earlier, Advanced Tissue said it would submit a premarket approval application for its Dermagraft product.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-3/8 to 19-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
